  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 — First published release: trading rules and account queries, never-retried order placement with clientOrderId idempotency, WebSocket klines and mark prices, and the user data stream (orders, fills, account deltas, margin calls, resync signals) with listenKey renewal, heartbeat-based idle detection, and StartAsync so callers can wait for a live connection before acting. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Binance/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
